\text { Conductivity } & =\frac{\text { Cell constant }}{\text { Resistance }} \\\\
\therefore \text { Cell constant } & =0.152 \times 10^{-3} \times 1750 \\\\
& =266 \times 10^{-3} \mathrm{~cm}^{-1}
\end{array}
$$

